msgid ""
"This email / password combination got hacked and leaked. To protect this "
"account, the password has been reset. Please use the \"Forgot my password\" "
"function below to set a new password. In the future, consider not installing "
"malware, Thank You."
msgstr ""
"Ova kombinacija e-pošte/lozinke je hakirana i procurila. Kako bismo "
"zaštitili ovaj račun, lozinka je resetirana. Molimo vas da koristite "
"funkciju \"Zaboravljena lozinka\" u nastavku kako biste postavili novu "
"lozinku. U budućnosti, razmislite o tome da ne instalirate zlonamjerni "
"softver. Hvala."

msgid ""
"This email / password combination got hacked and leaked. To protect this "
